<title>THAILAND: SOCCER-KING'S CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KING'S CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the four-nation King's Cup soccer tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p> Thailand   1   Romania    0  (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Piyapong Pue-on 54</p>
<p> Sweden     1   Japan	0  (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Anders Andersson 14</p>
<p>Standing (after first-round matches):</p>
<p>		     P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Sweden	    3   2   1   0   3   0   7</p>
<p> Thailand	  3   1   2   0   2   1   5</p>
<p> Japan	     3   0   2   1   2   3   2</p>
<p> Romania	   3   0   1   2   1   4   1</p>
<p>Next matches: February 16, Third place - Japan v Romania (0800 GMT kickoff), Final - Sweden v Thailand (1000 GMT kickoff).</p>
